WEBVTT

00:18:28.932 --> 00:18:30.799
and then everybody believed it is real

00:18:30.799 --> 00:18:33.354
and not done digitally
or through technology.

00:18:33.354 --> 00:18:35.097
So thank you for that, Sundar.

00:18:35.097 --> 00:18:40.387
Any message for the curious young Indians?

00:18:40.387 --> 00:18:44.427
From North to South, East to West.

00:18:44.437 --> 00:18:48.897
One parting message
to the young curious minds in India

00:18:50.376 --> 00:18:53.226
I would say, keep doing
what you are doing.

00:18:53.232 --> 00:18:56.154
All of us from the outside 
are so excited about India.

00:18:56.154 --> 00:19:00.779
We see so much potential.
Please stay the course.